<title>TURKEY: Turkish firm plans 40,000T durum wheat imports.</title>
<headline>Turkish firm plans 40,000T durum wheat imports.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Turkish pasta producer company is planning to import 40,000 tonnes of durum wheat with October and November delivery, a company official said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
